MEASUREMENT DISCLAIMER
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

SwingLab reports launch angle, exit velocity and bat attack angle. Those
numbers have NOT been validated against real footage or against any calibrated
reference instrument. The Phase 0 validation described in docs/VALIDATION.md
has not been carried out.

